1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 1)

2
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:43,278
Typhoon Xianlu, the seventh
typhoon of the season,

3
00:00:43,279 --> 00:00:45,638
made landfall at 11:36 this morning

4
00:00:45,639 --> 00:00:47,279
along our city's coast,

5
00:00:47,559 --> 00:00:49,039
and is tracking westward
from the southeast.

6
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,679
A Falcon 900...

7
00:00:51,359 --> 00:00:53,480
should easily withstand a tropical cyclone.

8
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:57,358
Minglong Group, led by
business tycoon Zhao Shengge,

9
00:00:57,359 --> 00:01:00,399
has launched an aggressive
wave of mergers and acquisitions.

10
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:00,999
Hello?

11
00:01:00,999 --> 00:01:01,639
Wan.

12
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:03,238
The crown prince is heading back.

13
00:01:03,239 --> 00:01:04,160
How are the preparations for the
welcome banquet coming along?

14
00:01:04,161 --> 00:01:05,239
Everything's ready.

15
00:01:05,599 --> 00:01:06,520
Whenever you and Young Master Tan

16
00:01:06,521 --> 00:01:08,401
have time, we can go
over the details together.

17
00:01:08,559 --> 00:01:10,559
No need. I trust your work.

18
00:01:11,559 --> 00:01:12,080
Hey.

19
00:01:12,279 --> 00:01:14,799
I heard he came back with Miss Xu.

20
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:15,919
No.

21
00:01:16,159 --> 00:01:17,159
He came back alone.

22
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:21,040
Lucas.

23
00:01:21,097 --> 00:01:22,216
Tell the legal department

24
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:23,399
to finalize the due diligence
report on Lai Chi Wun

25
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:24,440
and send it to me tonight.

26
00:01:26,439 --> 00:01:27,359
How do you know?

27
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:28,719
Did you go stalk him?

28
00:01:30,999 --> 00:01:31,999
It wasn't stalking.

29
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,120
I went to pick him up.

30
00:01:33,919 --> 00:01:34,719
Chen Wan.

31
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:36,279
Do you have a death wish or something?

32
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:55,880
I was worried.

33
00:01:56,106 --> 00:01:57,946
Things haven't been
peaceful lately.

34
00:01:58,719 --> 00:01:59,998
Is it really your place to worry?

35
00:01:59,999 --> 00:02:01,599
Worry about yourself instead.

36
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:02,559
If you step out of line again,

37
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,998
even I won't be able to bail you out.

38
00:02:03,999 --> 00:02:04,760
It's fine.

39
00:02:04,761 --> 00:02:06,001
I wasn't trying to do anything.

40
00:02:07,279 --> 00:02:08,320
You idiot.

41
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,840
You know me.

42
00:02:11,279 --> 00:02:12,518
I'm not asking for anything.

43
00:02:12,519 --> 00:02:14,760
As long as he's safe
and sound, that's enough.

44
00:02:16,159 --> 00:02:18,638
After winning that
David-and-Goliath lawsuit,

45
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:20,358
Zhao Shengge shot to fame.

46
00:02:20,359 --> 00:02:21,999
A Belgian financial journalist

47
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,399
dubbed it the "Golden Act."

48
00:02:25,639 --> 00:02:26,200
Boss.

49
00:02:26,201 --> 00:02:28,241
We received a few more
welcome banquet invitations.

50
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,320
Which one will you attend?

51
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:31,679
Shen Zongnian,

52
00:02:31,679 --> 00:02:32,679
Tan Youming,

53
00:02:33,359 --> 00:02:34,600
and Zhuo Zhixuan's.

54
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,040
Understood.

55
00:02:37,239 --> 00:02:38,359
You really have no regrets?

56
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:39,639
After all this time,

57
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:40,639
what is there to regret?

58
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:00,720
We've got trouble.

59
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:01,480
On the ramp ahead,

60
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:02,480
there's an SUV.

61
00:03:17,359 --> 00:03:18,919
I won't let you hurt him.

62
00:03:41,519 --> 00:03:42,040
Mr. Zhao.

63
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,678
There's a white BYD behind us.

64
00:03:43,679 --> 00:03:44,999
It looks like they're helping us.

65
00:03:45,399 --> 00:03:46,399
License plate?

66
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:47,799
Mr. Zhao,

67
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,240
the rain's too heavy to make it out.

68
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,760
Looks like it ends in 25.

69
00:03:51,519 --> 00:03:52,519
Look into it.

70
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,280
Also,

71
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:55,839
about White Crane Hall,

72
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:57,918
have Simon and his team
deal with it immediately.

73
00:03:57,919 --> 00:03:58,919
Yes, sir.

74
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:25,760
Boss.

75
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,000
We blew it.

76
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:28,519
Understood.

77
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:29,159
Boss.

78
00:04:29,399 --> 00:04:30,519
What did you call me in for?

79
00:04:32,839 --> 00:04:34,038
There's something

80
00:04:34,039 --> 00:04:35,439
I've been weighing for a long time.

81
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,320
I'd like your thoughts on it.

82
00:04:38,279 --> 00:04:40,838
It's about going legit
with White Crane Hall.

83
00:04:40,839 --> 00:04:41,920
Going legit?

84
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,478
Times have changed.

85
00:04:46,479 --> 00:04:47,839
All this bloodshed and violence...

86
00:04:48,039 --> 00:04:49,920
it's no way to survive in the long run.

87
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:52,519
I want to use the Lai Chi Wun project

88
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:54,719
to completely clean up White Crane Hall.

89
00:04:56,399 --> 00:04:58,880
Do the other elders know about this plan?

90
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,838
I haven't told them yet.

91
00:05:00,839 --> 00:05:01,760
I wanted to

92
00:05:01,761 --> 00:05:03,399
hear your take first.

93
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:07,559
I have no problem with going legit.

94
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:10,440
But landing that Lai Chi Wun project

95
00:05:10,719 --> 00:05:12,159
might be a tall order.

96
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:15,278
Word has it the Tan and Shen
families are determined to get it.

97
00:05:15,279 --> 00:05:16,320
Besides,

98
00:05:16,639 --> 00:05:17,599
standing behind them

99
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:19,079
is Zhao Shengge.

100
00:05:20,719 --> 00:05:22,000
What if...

101
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,920
I want to partner with them?

102
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:28,919
The crown prince's welcome
banquet is stacked with heavy hitters.

103
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:30,999
Looks like it's far
more than just a dinner.

104
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,718
Look who put this whole gathering together.

105
00:05:32,719 --> 00:05:35,799
Tan Youming, grandson of
the former Secretary for Justice,

106
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:38,439
and Shen Zongnian, heir to the Stock King.

107
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:40,638
Not to mention they grew up together.

108
00:05:40,639 --> 00:05:42,158
Now that the young master
is back in the country...

109
00:05:42,159 --> 00:05:42,719
Mr. Chen.

110
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:43,919
The temperature for this aperitif

111
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,880
is set at twenty-one degrees.

112
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:45,880
Does that work for you?

113
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,120
That works.

114
00:06:28,519 --> 00:06:29,360
Next,

115
00:06:29,361 --> 00:06:31,241
we'll restructure the
company's business model.

116
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:33,760
The client is coming in from Shenzhen.

117
00:06:33,959 --> 00:06:35,399
Who should we send to receive them?

118
00:06:36,399 --> 00:06:36,920
Alright.

119
00:06:37,399 --> 00:06:38,399
Leave it to me.

120
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:41,920
Mr. Chen.

121
00:06:41,921 --> 00:06:43,799
Here are tonight's food and wine menus.

122
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,838
Please take a look.

123
00:06:44,839 --> 00:06:45,958
If everything looks good,

124
00:06:45,959 --> 00:06:47,959
the kitchen can begin prep.

125
00:06:48,399 --> 00:06:48,680
Alright.

126
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,680
Let me see.

127
00:06:49,896 --> 00:06:51,969
[TN: I was bracing myself for a AI-generated
menu but these are all just regular dishes]

128
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:53,519
Looks good.

129
00:06:53,519 --> 00:06:53,839
Great.

130
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:54,958
Lower the temperature just a bit.

131
00:06:54,959 --> 00:06:56,518
Serve the wine once all the guests arrive.

132
00:06:56,519 --> 00:06:57,360
No need to let it breathe all the way.

133
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,400
Seventy percent should do.

134
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:03,638
Mr. Chen, long time no see. Hello.

135
00:07:03,639 --> 00:07:04,039
Long time no see.

136
00:07:04,039 --> 00:07:04,560
I'll let you get back to it.

137
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:04,920
Sure.

138
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,360
Bye.

139
00:07:07,159 --> 00:07:08,159
Wan.

140
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,920
Zhao Shengge will be here any minute.

141
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,159
Sounds about right.

142
00:07:13,279 --> 00:07:14,279
It's about time.

143
00:07:14,320 --> 00:07:15,519
He's always punctual.

144
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:16,680
Come on.

145
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,399
I'm telling you,

146
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,680
tonight is a golden opportunity.

147
00:07:19,159 --> 00:07:21,158
You think people came
here just for the food?

148
00:07:21,159 --> 00:07:21,800
Every single one of them

149
00:07:21,801 --> 00:07:23,721
is looking to get in Zhao
Shengge's good graces.

150
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:27,320
That's simply a given,
considering Mr. Zhao's status.

151
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:28,760
No,

152
00:07:28,761 --> 00:07:30,240
why aren't you getting what I mean?

153
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,680
Mr. Zhao is here.

154
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:32,880
Mr. Zhao.

155
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:34,880
Mr. Zhao.

156
00:07:35,039 --> 00:07:35,399
Hello.

157
00:07:35,399 --> 00:07:36,399
Mr. Zhao.

158
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:53,959
Good evening.

159
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:55,360
Sorry to keep you waiting.

160
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:56,760
Everyone,

161
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:58,599
long time no see.

162
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,958
Mr. Zhao, long time no see!

163
00:07:59,959 --> 00:08:01,079
Long time no see, Mr. Zhao.

164
00:08:01,159 --> 00:08:02,695
Good evening, Mr. Zhao. Long time no see.

165
00:08:02,719 --> 00:08:03,719
Mr. Zhao.

166
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:04,880
Mr. Zhao.

167
00:08:05,639 --> 00:08:07,158
Mr. Zhao, you've had a long trip.

168
00:08:07,159 --> 00:08:08,159
You must be exhausted.

169
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:09,800
Mr. Zhao, thank you for coming.

170
00:08:10,039 --> 00:08:12,679
The winds and waves have
been quite rough in Haishi lately.

171
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,319
Riding the storm is where the fun is.

172
00:08:14,320 --> 00:08:15,519
That's Mr. Zhao for you.

173
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:16,999
Always unfazed by the roughest storms.

174
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,999
I hope we'll have the chance
to work together, Mr. Zhao.

175
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:20,000
Long time no see.

176
00:08:25,039 --> 00:08:26,120
Go say hello.

177
00:08:27,079 --> 00:08:28,079
There's no need.

178
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:32,639
Mr. Chen, excuse me.

179
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:34,398
The kitchen said

180
00:08:34,399 --> 00:08:37,078
the mango shipment from the Vietnam
border was grounded by the typhoon.

181
00:08:37,079 --> 00:08:39,559
They can't make the mango
pomelo sago or the pudding crepes.

182
00:08:39,560 --> 00:08:42,479
Could we switch the
dessert to red bean soup?

183
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:45,680
Young Master Tan,

184
00:08:45,681 --> 00:08:47,601
are you coming to my
birthday party next Friday?

185
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:48,599
You have all the luck!

186
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,878
Nobody else can ever get him to show up.

187
00:08:49,879 --> 00:08:50,879
Indeed.

188
00:08:51,719 --> 00:08:52,719
Come here.

189
00:08:53,239 --> 00:08:54,239
Mr. Shen.

190
00:09:03,119 --> 00:09:04,440
Excuse me for a moment.

191
00:09:04,839 --> 00:09:05,920
Sure, see you next time.

192
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:18,959
Turn the AC down

193
00:09:19,479 --> 00:09:20,598
another degree or degree and a half.

194
00:09:20,599 --> 00:09:20,879
Got it.

195
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:22,118
Turn on the dehumidifier too.

196
00:09:22,119 --> 00:09:23,119
No problem.

197
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:38,719
What's this?

198
00:09:38,719 --> 00:09:39,799
I haven't seen this before.

199
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:42,478
Mr. Chen arranged this
specially for everyone.

200
00:09:42,479 --> 00:09:44,680
It's gotu kola and rehmannia herbal tea.

201
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:47,479
Try it.

202
00:09:47,879 --> 00:09:48,879
Not bad.

203
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:53,640
Pretty good.

204
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:54,680
It's been so stifling lately.

205
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:55,680
This hits the spot.

206
00:09:55,800 --> 00:09:56,239
Nian,

207
00:09:56,239 --> 00:09:56,839
have some more.

208
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:57,440
Let's go.

209
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,440
Let's raise a glass.

210
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:04,920
Let's do it.

211
00:10:13,599 --> 00:10:14,160
Shengge.

212
00:10:14,479 --> 00:10:15,479
This is Chen Wan.

213
00:10:15,999 --> 00:10:17,319
Boss, we found the owner.

214
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:19,240
The car is registered to
someone named Chen Wan.

215
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:30,680
Hello.

216
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:33,160
Mr. Zhao.

217
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:34,400
Hello.

218
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:37,159
Tonight's banquet

219
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:38,520
was handled entirely by Chen Wan.

220
00:10:39,759 --> 00:10:40,759
Shengge,

221
00:10:40,999 --> 00:10:42,839
you've actually got
quite an appetite tonight.

222
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:44,478
You finished your wine,

223
00:10:44,479 --> 00:10:45,680
and drank all your tea too.

224
00:10:46,119 --> 00:10:47,200
The food was too your liking?

225
00:10:49,479 --> 00:10:50,239
Now that's a rare compliment.

226
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,935
Coming from our
hard-to-please young master.

227
00:10:51,959 --> 00:10:52,719
By the way, Wan,

228
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:54,000
how about bowling tomorrow?

229
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:56,238
The Border Gate Light Rail East
Line is finally moving forward.

230
00:10:56,239 --> 00:10:57,640
I can take Shengge to check it out.

231
00:10:58,200 --> 00:11:00,479
Holi Mansion is right across the bridge.

232
00:11:00,599 --> 00:11:02,335
We could wait until the typhoon
passes the day after tomorrow,

233
00:11:02,359 --> 00:11:03,975
and go bowling and camping there together.

234
00:11:03,999 --> 00:11:04,999
The view is stunning.

235
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:06,560
Yeah.

236
00:11:07,119 --> 00:11:08,280
In this miserable weather,

237
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:09,920
Wan always thinks of everything.

238
00:11:10,239 --> 00:11:11,200
I'll have the manager

239
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,200
bring more tea.

240
00:11:12,479 --> 00:11:13,759
Please, enjoy your conversation.

241
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:20,599
Not bad.

242
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,200
Shengge,

243
00:11:22,239 --> 00:11:23,520
Wan is completely solid.

244
00:11:23,879 --> 00:11:24,879
You can count on him.

245
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:28,400
Shen Zongnian,

246
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:29,400
back me up here.

247
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,040
Count on him.

248
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:34,440
I didn't say otherwise.

249
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:37,159
It's a miracle talking to you two

250
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:38,280
hasn't killed me yet.

251
00:11:42,999 --> 00:11:44,160
Alright, I'm heading out.

252
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:44,999
See you around.

253
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,200
Bye.

254
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:50,920
Wan,

255
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,879
heading to Lan Kwai Fong tonight?

256
00:11:53,239 --> 00:11:54,479
Some guests are still here.

257
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:56,079
I'll pass.

258
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,280
Alright then.

259
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:59,016
Regarding the land in Lai Chi Wun,

260
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:00,640
have Legal recheck the chain of title.

261
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:03,296
There were issues with
the previous due diligence.

262
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,320
Also,

263
00:12:04,599 --> 00:12:05,959
keep a close eye

264
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:07,840
on Mak Ka Fai from White Crane Hall.

265
00:12:08,119 --> 00:12:09,119
See you soon.

266
00:12:09,999 --> 00:12:10,999
That's all.

267
00:12:29,119 --> 00:12:30,439
There's a white BYD behind us...

268
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,760
It looks like they're helping us.

269
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:34,280
Chen Wan.

270
00:12:53,359 --> 00:12:54,359
Hold it right there.

271
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:57,680
You've been back for days,

272
00:12:58,839 --> 00:13:00,320
and you only show your face now?

273
00:13:01,119 --> 00:13:03,160
Do you have any regard
left for the Zhao family?

274
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:06,560
You show less and less
respect for me every day.

275
00:13:09,479 --> 00:13:10,640
Don't you forget,

276
00:13:11,759 --> 00:13:13,280
everything you have today

277
00:13:14,239 --> 00:13:15,719
was handed to you by the Zhao family.

278
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:19,496
You don't have an ounce of humanity in you.

279
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:21,400
Isn't ruthless what you
always wanted me to be?

280
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:23,280
You...

281
00:14:08,759 --> 00:14:09,479
Boss,

282
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:11,520
I sent Chen Wan's profile to your inbox.

283
00:14:35,680 --> 00:14:36,680
I think

284
00:14:36,759 --> 00:14:39,040
everyone knows why we've gathered today.

285
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:39,959
Boss,

286
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,200
what's the move now?

287
00:14:41,359 --> 00:14:42,359
Hold on.

288
00:14:42,599 --> 00:14:44,879
I want to hear everyone's thoughts first.

289
00:14:45,599 --> 00:14:48,200
After all, White Crane Hall
doesn't belong to me alone.

290
00:14:48,999 --> 00:14:50,280
I follow the boss.

291
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:52,560
I'm only second-in-command.

292
00:14:53,239 --> 00:14:54,239
You

293
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:56,079
are the shot-caller we chose.

294
00:14:59,719 --> 00:15:00,879
Boss,

295
00:15:01,119 --> 00:15:03,639
I'm just the accountant
for White Crane Hall.

296
00:15:03,640 --> 00:15:05,079
I only manage the money.

297
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:07,159
When it comes to turf wars and violence,

298
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:08,719
count me out.

299
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:10,920
Fine.

300
00:15:11,239 --> 00:15:13,119
Then here's where I stand.

301
00:15:13,959 --> 00:15:16,680
The Tan family operates
with a softer touch.

302
00:15:16,839 --> 00:15:17,839
But the Zhao family...

303
00:15:18,119 --> 00:15:19,959
especially this Zhao Shengge,

304
00:15:20,640 --> 00:15:22,160
he plays both sides?arrot and stick.

305
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:24,496
He's even more ruthless than Zhao Maozheng.

306
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:26,560
Rather than butting heads with them,

307
00:15:26,839 --> 00:15:28,598
we might as well ride the current

308
00:15:28,599 --> 00:15:30,119
and do him a major favor,

309
00:15:30,879 --> 00:15:32,680
in exchange for long-term payoffs.

310
00:15:33,400 --> 00:15:35,800
Payoffs are payoffs,

311
00:15:36,599 --> 00:15:39,280
but who actually benefits long-term?

312
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:42,799
That whole area in Lai Chi Wun

313
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:44,719
floods whenever a typhoon hits.

314
00:15:44,999 --> 00:15:48,718
Why not use the Zhao
and Tan families' resources

315
00:15:48,719 --> 00:15:51,319
to help your crew and their families

316
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:53,039
get a better life?

317
00:15:53,040 --> 00:15:54,040
Wouldn't that be better?

318
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:55,560
Don't you think?

319
00:15:57,759 --> 00:15:59,519
Preaching righteousness and virtue,

320
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:01,239
while secretly counting his own coin.

321
00:16:02,680 --> 00:16:04,239
Everyone calm down.

322
00:16:04,400 --> 00:16:05,799
The word just got out.

323
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:06,800
Nothing is set in stone.

324
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:08,320
Wait until I

325
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,320
reach out to them.

326
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:14,039
Pray you carve a path
between life and death,

327
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:18,279
as I send your soul
straight to hell's gate.

328
00:16:18,280 --> 00:16:20,479
White Crane Hall Leader
Found Dead in the Street.

329
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:22,718
Fatal Call Traced to Minglong Heir.

330
00:16:22,719 --> 00:16:25,439
Heard Minglong is pouring funds
to take over the Lai Chi Wun project.

331
00:16:25,440 --> 00:16:27,279
The Tans took a back seat.

332
00:16:27,280 --> 00:16:28,935
No sooner did he take over
than Mak Ka Fai wound up dead.

333
00:16:28,959 --> 00:16:30,999
A life taken over a plot of land...

334
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:33,440
Come in.

335
00:16:33,959 --> 00:16:35,358
Where did you run off to yesterday?

336
00:16:35,359 --> 00:16:37,320
The boss missing such a
crucial patent meeting...

337
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,479
It's totally ridiculous.

338
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:40,400
I have faith in your abilities.

339
00:16:40,599 --> 00:16:41,599
You can handle it.

340
00:16:42,119 --> 00:16:43,680
Don't flatter me.

341
00:16:43,839 --> 00:16:45,640
That smile of yours is what tricked me

342
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:47,160
into boarding this pirate ship.

343
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:49,119
By the way,

344
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:50,800
Mr. Zhou got back to us.

345
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:52,800
He said he's open to meeting up with you.

346
00:16:53,040 --> 00:16:53,800
Sounds good.

347
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:54,599
Set it up.

348
00:16:54,759 --> 00:16:55,919
Any time works

349
00:16:55,920 --> 00:16:57,440
except the night after tomorrow.

350
00:16:57,999 --> 00:16:59,560
Except the night after tomorrow?

351
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:06,040
Baby,

352
00:17:06,320 --> 00:17:07,519
today is the Ghost Festival.

353
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:08,959
Remember to come home for dinner.

354
00:17:45,519 --> 00:17:46,519
No way.

355
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:49,519
Is that him?

356
00:17:49,520 --> 00:17:52,119
He wasn't brought back to the
Chen family until he was nine.

357
00:17:52,120 --> 00:17:55,279
Lived in the courtyard
doghouse for a year and a half.

358
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:57,199
How pathetic.

359
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:58,359
Heard he lost his mind,

360
00:17:58,360 --> 00:17:59,998
stabbed right through someone's hand,

361
00:17:59,999 --> 00:18:02,200
and got locked away at
Mount Lanshan for three years.

362
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:05,920
Hey.

363
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:08,920
Say hello.

364
00:18:09,559 --> 00:18:10,559
Good morning.

365
00:18:11,519 --> 00:18:12,519
Carry on.

366
00:18:18,759 --> 00:18:19,559
Who is it?

367
00:18:19,759 --> 00:18:20,880
Mom, it's me.

368
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:24,920
My baby.

369
00:18:25,519 --> 00:18:26,519
Come in.

370
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:36,880
Where is it?

371
00:18:39,160 --> 00:18:41,920
It's not entirely my fault.

372
00:18:42,759 --> 00:18:45,080
Cao Zhi withheld my dividend,

373
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,798
and Liao Liu cheated at mahjong

374
00:18:46,799 --> 00:18:48,359
and swindled my Bulgari set away.

375
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:49,719
It drove me out of my mind!

376
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:53,279
Move out, alright?

377
00:18:54,239 --> 00:18:55,399
You can live anywhere you want.

378
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,519
A villa, a duplex...

379
00:18:56,959 --> 00:18:57,959
As for him,

380
00:18:58,959 --> 00:19:00,680
I'll talk to him, okay?

381
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:03,080
I'm not leaving.

382
00:19:03,719 --> 00:19:04,919
Until we get what's rightfully ours,

383
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:06,119
I'd rather die right here.

384
00:19:06,120 --> 00:19:07,199
Even if you die here,

385
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:08,400
he still won't give it to you.

386
00:19:08,519 --> 00:19:10,080
Then I'll take it myself.

387
00:19:10,519 --> 00:19:11,080
You...

388
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:12,039
After all these years,

389
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:13,519
why haven't you figured it out?

390
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:15,080
Sweetheart,

391
00:19:15,279 --> 00:19:16,798
you're all Mommy has left.

392
00:19:16,799 --> 00:19:18,359
You have to make something of yourself.

393
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:19,680
Alright?

394
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:21,759
Listen to me.

395
00:19:22,360 --> 00:19:23,400
Lately,

396
00:19:23,719 --> 00:19:25,399
Xie Jiajian has been asking me out.

397
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:26,840
Don't go.

398
00:19:30,479 --> 00:19:31,798
How much money do you need?

399
00:19:31,799 --> 00:19:32,600
I can earn it.

400
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:33,600
I'll give it to you.

401
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:40,479
He's a married man.

402
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:42,719
He doesn't really care about you.

403
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:45,919
Who cares about true feelings?

404
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:47,719
I'm just having a meal with him

405
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:50,439
to see if he has a way

406
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:52,119
to get you into Rongxin.

407
00:19:52,120 --> 00:19:54,079
It's your father's business, after all.

408
00:19:54,080 --> 00:19:55,238
I'm not going to Rongxin.

409
00:19:55,239 --> 00:19:56,600
I have my own work to do.

410
00:19:56,840 --> 00:19:58,880
What could you possibly do?

411
00:19:59,799 --> 00:20:00,958
Sweetheart,

412
00:20:00,959 --> 00:20:02,600
Mommy is so worried about you.

413
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:04,478
You graduated years ago,

414
00:20:04,479 --> 00:20:06,959
and haven't even stepped
through the doors of a branch office.

415
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:10,080
I lose sleep at night worrying about you.

416
00:20:10,759 --> 00:20:12,879
Then stop stressing over my life.

417
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:13,880
Can you do that?

418
00:20:13,959 --> 00:20:15,119
Just look after yourself.

419
00:20:15,120 --> 00:20:17,200
Take care of yourself, okay?

420
00:20:18,319 --> 00:20:19,559
Fine, fine, I get it, I get it.

421
00:20:21,479 --> 00:20:23,239
Is the money I sent you enough?

422
00:20:24,279 --> 00:20:24,999
Fourth Madam.

423
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,639
The master wants everyone
downstairs to pay respects.

424
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:27,680
Okay, coming.

425
00:20:28,080 --> 00:20:28,799
Come on, let's go.

426
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:30,038
Your father is calling.

427
00:20:30,039 --> 00:20:31,039
Let's go.

428
00:21:10,999 --> 00:21:11,999
Chen Yu.

429
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:14,719
You start at Rongxin next week.

430
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:16,879
When you're working at the company,

431
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:18,000
remember to take initiative.

432
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:20,759
Don't wait for people to nag you.

433
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:21,959
Mind your manners.

434
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:24,359
Don't worry, that's what I'm best at.

435
00:21:24,360 --> 00:21:25,360
By the way, Mom,

436
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:26,440
a couple of days ago,

437
00:21:26,600 --> 00:21:30,478
Uncle Liao and I scouted a plot in Barra.

438
00:21:30,479 --> 00:21:31,920
We're planning to build a...

439
00:21:32,120 --> 00:21:33,798
More accurately, the Liao family

440
00:21:33,799 --> 00:21:36,160
wants to develop an
integrated commercial district.

441
00:21:36,400 --> 00:21:37,840
I think in our whole family,

442
00:21:38,160 --> 00:21:39,278
Dad is the only one who can pull it off.

443
00:21:39,279 --> 00:21:41,639
I consulted a feng shui master,

444
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:42,479
and this land

445
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,758
has tremendous fortune ahead.

446
00:21:43,759 --> 00:21:44,680
Once we acquire it,

447
00:21:44,681 --> 00:21:46,759
Rongxin's stock price could easily double.

448
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:50,879
No business talk at the table.

449
00:21:50,880 --> 00:21:51,880
Eat up.

450
00:21:52,719 --> 00:21:53,200
Dad,

451
00:21:53,319 --> 00:21:54,319
have some too.

452
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:55,640
Dad,

453
00:21:55,999 --> 00:21:59,479
I heard Zhao Shengge came
back a couple of days ago.

454
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:02,400
The high-society heirs
threw a welcome banquet.

455
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:05,318
Why didn't our family
receive an invitation?

456
00:22:05,319 --> 00:22:06,798
No matter what,

457
00:22:06,799 --> 00:22:09,559
my dad is someone of status in Haishi.

458
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:13,160
Do you really need me

459
00:22:13,600 --> 00:22:14,920
to teach you how the world works?

460
00:22:15,959 --> 00:22:16,959
Sorry, Dad.

461
00:22:18,080 --> 00:22:20,758
The golden boy spent
years dealing in US dollars.

462
00:22:20,759 --> 00:22:21,519
I imagine

463
00:22:21,520 --> 00:22:24,279
he looks down on our
little corner of Haishi now.

464
00:22:24,719 --> 00:22:25,440
His ego

465
00:22:25,441 --> 00:22:27,120
is even more obnoxious than before.

466
00:22:30,080 --> 00:22:31,080
Don't talk nonsense.

467
00:22:32,680 --> 00:22:35,440
No matter how big he gets, he
still has to settle down in Haishi.

468
00:22:35,959 --> 00:22:36,840
If you ask me,

469
00:22:36,841 --> 00:22:39,199
as long as the young
ladies set their sights on him

470
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:40,719
and hit the jackpot,

471
00:22:41,160 --> 00:22:43,799
our ties would run far
deeper than casual visits.

472
00:22:48,080 --> 00:22:48,719
Wan,

473
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:50,159
why have you lost so much weight lately?

474
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:52,360
Is the food not to your liking?

475
00:22:52,759 --> 00:22:54,080
No, of course not.

476
00:22:54,559 --> 00:22:55,798
It's just too hot.

477
00:22:55,799 --> 00:22:57,200
I haven't had much of an appetite.

478
00:22:57,640 --> 00:22:59,080
Well, obviously.

479
00:22:59,279 --> 00:23:01,399
Our Wan spends all his time with
the young master of the Zhuo family,

480
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:02,558
dining together.

481
00:23:02,559 --> 00:23:05,640
After feasting with the elite, how
could he stomach our humble table?

482
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:07,920
Wan,

483
00:23:08,200 --> 00:23:11,360
Young Master Zhuo hangs out with
those scions every day, doesn't he?

484
00:23:11,600 --> 00:23:13,798
If you ever get the chance to move up,

485
00:23:13,799 --> 00:23:15,039
remember to look out

486
00:23:15,440 --> 00:23:16,919
for the Chen family.

487
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:17,975
I don't have that kind of pull.

488
00:23:17,999 --> 00:23:20,039
I only park cars for Young Master Zhuo.

489
00:23:20,759 --> 00:23:22,359
What could you possibly expect from him?

490
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:25,240
They just treat him like an errand boy.

491
00:23:26,519 --> 00:23:28,159
Why would they give him any real respect?

492
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:31,480
Master, the auspicious hour has arrived.

493
00:23:36,160 --> 00:23:37,238
Heaven and Earth, Yin and Yang,

494
00:23:37,239 --> 00:23:38,160
all primordial breath and living souls,

495
00:23:38,161 --> 00:23:40,039
by the decree of the Maoshan Patriarch,

496
00:23:40,319 --> 00:23:42,159
we summon the Three
Lords of Mao to descend!

497
00:23:42,160 --> 00:23:45,959
Sealed with this talisman,
command the clouds to manifest at once!

498
00:23:46,160 --> 00:23:47,719
Swiftly as the law decrees!

499
00:23:58,840 --> 00:23:59,600
Pure heaven, sacred earth,

500
00:23:59,600 --> 00:24:00,279
all ghosts return to the shadows.

501
00:24:00,279 --> 00:24:00,999
Today, the Chen family

502
00:24:00,999 --> 00:24:01,680
lays out the Ullambana offerings.

503
00:24:01,681 --> 00:24:04,241
By the decree of the Grand
Supreme Elder Lord, swift as the law!

504
00:24:16,600 --> 00:24:17,839
Pure heaven, sacred earth, all
ghosts return to the shadows.

505
00:24:17,840 --> 00:24:19,616
By the decree of the Grand
Supreme Elder Lord, swift as the law!

506
00:24:19,640 --> 00:24:22,200
By the decree of the Grand
Supreme Elder Lord, swift as the law!

507
00:24:36,440 --> 00:24:39,120
A dog should know its place.

508
00:24:58,265 --> 00:24:59,265
Wan.

509
00:25:01,200 --> 00:25:02,200
It's me.

510
00:25:02,799 --> 00:25:04,200
Put the knife down first.

511
00:25:05,239 --> 00:25:06,319
So what if it's you?

512
00:25:06,999 --> 00:25:08,758
I haven't seen you in a long time,

513
00:25:08,759 --> 00:25:10,200
and just wanted to talk.

514
00:25:11,640 --> 00:25:13,159
A peaceful home brings
prosperity, doesn't it?

515
00:25:13,160 --> 00:25:14,215
If brother-in-law sees this,

516
00:25:14,239 --> 00:25:15,440
he'll lecture you again.

517
00:25:16,319 --> 00:25:17,640
What if he does?

518
00:25:17,999 --> 00:25:20,400
You think you can pack me
off to Mount Lanshan again?

519
00:25:20,840 --> 00:25:22,079
Let me tell you,

520
00:25:22,080 --> 00:25:23,399
you can't touch me anymore.

521
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:24,440
As for me...

522
00:25:24,519 --> 00:25:26,640
I can cut off your fingers all over again.

523
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:29,920
Tell me.

524
00:25:30,080 --> 00:25:30,799
This time,

525
00:25:30,800 --> 00:25:32,160
which finger do you want to lose?

526
00:26:57,959 --> 00:26:58,959
Hello?

527
00:26:59,279 --> 00:27:00,279
Good evening, Mr. Chen.

528
00:27:03,640 --> 00:27:04,640
Monica.

529
00:27:05,080 --> 00:27:06,680
Sorry to disturb you so late.

530
00:27:07,239 --> 00:27:09,519
You missed your follow-up
appointment last week,

531
00:27:10,039 --> 00:27:13,359
and the prescription I gave you shouldn't
be taken continuously without evaluation.

532
00:27:13,440 --> 00:27:15,479
That's why I had to call you.

533
00:27:17,039 --> 00:27:18,039
I'm sorry, Monica.

534
00:27:19,120 --> 00:27:20,360
It was my fault for missing it.

535
00:27:21,080 --> 00:27:22,600
Please charge me for the last session.

536
00:27:23,759 --> 00:27:24,799
It's on me.

537
00:27:25,279 --> 00:27:27,120
Mr. Chen, that's not what I meant.

538
00:27:27,759 --> 00:27:29,440
Are you free tomorrow or the day after?

539
00:27:29,959 --> 00:27:32,399
Could you make time to come
in for an in-person consultation?

540
00:27:32,519 --> 00:27:34,399
This phase of treatment is critical.

541
00:27:34,400 --> 00:27:35,520
It shouldn't be interrupted.

542
00:27:37,039 --> 00:27:38,239
If possible,

543
00:27:39,840 --> 00:27:40,840
would right now work?

544
00:27:42,239 --> 00:27:43,279
Hey, Zhao Shengge.

545
00:27:43,799 --> 00:27:44,799
Have you seen the news?

546
00:27:45,160 --> 00:27:46,160
Haven't had time.

547
00:27:47,160 --> 00:27:48,399
Mak Ka Fai is dead.

548
00:27:48,400 --> 00:27:49,440
He jumped from a building.

549
00:27:49,840 --> 00:27:51,239
Now everyone is saying

550
00:27:51,440 --> 00:27:52,640
you did it.

551
00:27:53,279 --> 00:27:54,319
Did you do it or not?

552
00:27:54,840 --> 00:27:56,120
If it were me,

553
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:58,880
I'd have made him vanish without a trace.

554
00:28:05,479 --> 00:28:07,039
I pierced their veins,

555
00:28:08,080 --> 00:28:09,400
severed their right fingers.

556
00:28:10,279 --> 00:28:12,160
Even dogs wouldn't touch their bones.

557
00:28:15,120 --> 00:28:15,680
Hurry! After him!

558
00:28:15,959 --> 00:28:17,039
He has nowhere left to run!

559
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:20,239
He's on the ground floor!

560
00:28:20,799 --> 00:28:21,839
Quick, cut him off!

561
00:28:21,840 --> 00:28:22,880
Don't let him get away!

562
00:28:24,640 --> 00:28:25,958
He went for the back door!

563
00:28:25,959 --> 00:28:27,120
Over here, quick!

564
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:32,400
Stop right there!

565
00:28:34,360 --> 00:28:35,360
This way!

566
00:28:35,400 --> 00:28:36,959
He ran toward the orphanage!

567
00:29:19,440 --> 00:29:22,319
Zhao Shengge's charity
gala is about to start.

568
00:29:27,039 --> 00:29:28,039
I have to get going.

569
00:29:28,360 --> 00:29:30,720
If you want any fruit from
the table, feel free to take it.
